<%--@elvariable id="redirectUrl" type="java.lang.String"--%>
<tr class="spaceNote" id="${idManualHint}" style="display: none">
  <td colspan="2">
    <div class="attentionComment">
      Please manually create a dedicated application in JetBrains Space with the following parameters:<br/><br/>
      <table class="applicationUrls">
        <tr>
          <td>Requested rights for specific features:</td>
          <td>
            <details>
              <summary><strong>Authenticating in TeamCity via Space</strong></summary>
              Members | View member profile<br/>
            </details>
            <c:set var="mergeRequestsEnabled" value="${spaceFeatures.mergeRequestsEnabled()}"/>
            <c:if test="${mergeRequestsEnabled}">
              <details>
                <summary><strong>Merge Requests Integration</strong></summary>
                Members | View member profile<br/>
                Project | View project data<br/>
                Git Repositories | Read<br/>
                Code Review | View code reviews
              </details>
            </c:if>
            <c:set var="commitStatusPublisherEnabled" value="${spaceFeatures.commitStatusEnabled()}"></c:set>
            <c:if test="${commitStatusPublisherEnabled}">
              <details>
                <summary><strong>Commit Status Publisher</strong></summary>
                Git Repositories | Report external check status
              </details>
            </c:if>
            <c:if test="${spaceFeatures.projectLevelConnectionEnabled()}">
              <details>
                <summary><strong>Create Project Connections</strong></summary>
                Applications | Create
              </details>
            </c:if>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Authentication:</td>
          <td>
            <strong>Authorization Code Flow</strong>,
            <strong>Client Credentials Flow</strong>
          </td>
        </tr>
      </table>
      <br/>
      In Authorization tab you need to authorize rights for the necessary projects<br/><br/>
      In the "Code Flow redirect URIs" field, enter the following redirect URLs:<br/>
      <oauth:urlTable>
        <tr>
          <td>
            <oauth:redirectUrl id="firstSpaceRootUrl" value="${redirectUrl}" style="width:35em;"/>
          </td>
        </tr>
      </oauth:urlTable>
      <br/>
      Once created, enter the <strong>Space server URL</strong> and the app's <strong>Client ID</strong> | <strong>Secret</strong> in the form below.
      <bs:help file="Connect+to+JetBrains+Space"/><br/><br/>
    </div>
  </td>
</tr>